  accTitle: The URL retriever owns cache failure fallback
  accDescr: A browser requests a URL. The retriever tries the cache and reaches its timeout. The retriever then reads the database and returns a redirect to the browser.
  B["Browser"] -->|"GET /abc"| R["URL<br/>retriever"]
  R -->|"Try cache;<br/>bounded<br/>wait"| C[("Unavailable<br/>cache")]
  R -->|"After<br/>timeout:<br/>read URL"| D[("URL<br/>database")]
